#3020
The Broken Highway~
   The old causeway ends here in a field of broken paving.  South, the
road runs back toward the settled lands; north it sinks into a grey
plain where nothing green has lived since the war.  A leaning milepost
still stands at the roadside, its lettering half-erased by salt wind.~
30 0 2
D0
   The highway resumes through the ash toward a ruined tollhouse.
~
~
