#3021
Ruins of the March Tollhouse~
   The tollhouse is a shell of blackened stone, its roof burned away
and its tollgate lying in splinters across the road.  Ash has drifted
in through the empty windows and lies in soft grey drifts against the
hearth.  The highway passes through here, north and south.~
