#3022
The Ashen Fields~
   Grey ash lies knee-deep in every furrow, and the stubble of the last
crop stands bleached and brittle in it.  Here and there a rusted
ploughshare or a helmet rests where its owner dropped it.  The war road
runs north through the fields, and a fence line can be seen west.~
