#3025
The Cannon Square~
   A square battery platform of rammed earth and timber dominates this
field, ringed by the rusted barrels of guns spiked long ago.  Ash
drifts about the wheels of the gun carriages.  The deserters of the
Marches have hung their washing between two barrels.~
