#3036
The Collapsed Bastion~
   A corner bastion of Fort Sunder has fallen bodily down the hillside,
dragging its wall with it, and the stones have come to rest in a wild
slope of rubble.  Between the fallen blocks there are tunnels of a
kind, and more than one is big enough to hold something.~
