Crossroads of the Marches~
   Four tracks meet here in a puddle of grey mud:  the old war road
running north and south, a breastwork track from the west, and a
cart road east toward the fort.  A fingerpost stands in the middle,
its arms pointing four ways and its plate long since pried off.~
