#3038
The Old Rampart~
   An ancient rampart of earth and stone, older by far than the war,
runs along the crest here.  Its ditch is choked with ash, and sheep
crops nothing on its flank, for nothing eats what grows in the
Marches.  The trench line drops away south.~
