#3039
The Ridge Path~
   The path follows the spine of the ridge, and the wind here carries
salt and the smell of stagnant water.  Below to the north the land
falls away into a drowned valley, and across it, half-hidden in
cloud, a dark tower of ash-coloured stone rises out of the flood.~
