The Great Hall of Fort Sunder~
   The hall is a long vault of black stone, its roof beams charred and
its floor scarred by fire.  Trestle tables have been pushed against
the walls, and above the cold hearth hangs a banner that has been
taken down and put up again so often that the silk is worn through.~
